Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:19:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Real TBC case: a waiting card delivered into another thread
 speaks that thread's language

A scheduled check in an English goal thread delivered a waiting introduction
request into its own Georgian request thread, and the card was written in the
run's English (the tester's 60161 [d], 15 Oct 13:32). The card's target thread
is now chosen before it is rendered, and a card landing elsewhere is rendered
in the target thread's language; at home it keeps the run's language, and a
failed read falls back to it with a log line. No text changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
